      "Rating",
      "This game can be brutal to some as it can cause you a stressful time knowing that the lives of the townspeople are in your hands and that every choice you make has a backlash. That being said, although I personally haven't played the game myself, I have seen other people play it and I liked it because of all the mystery and culture the game showcases. Think about the level of realism this game presents to its players, it makes you experience the slow starvation that brings you to the brink of death, as well as the confusion of being deceived and used by others for their own gain. The deep complexion of this story is what brings me to say that this story is deserving of this rating. It makes it interesting and meaningful.",
